        "description": "Evidence of intraepithelial pagetoid spread on histology",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Histopathological confirmation of sebaceous differentiation with cytologic atypia plus compatible clinical presentation",
    "notes": "Diagnosis often requires multiple biopsies due to pagetoid spread and clinical mimicry of benign conditions."
